  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the network shown below, the charge accumulated in the capacitor in steady state will be:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f46193fb-0132-406f-bc93-2dd8fe39fddb.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 261px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
